  _landmarkId: kapalicarsi
  _displayTitle: "Kapal\u0131\xE7ar\u015F\u0131"
  _shortDescription: "K\xF6kleri 15. y\xFCzy\u0131la uzanan Kapal\u0131\xE7ar\u015F\u0131,
    kubbeli ge\xE7itleri ve binlerce d\xFCkk\xE2n\u0131yla ya\u015Fayan bir ticaret
    labirentidir. M\xFCcevherden hal\u0131ya uzanan zanaat gelene\u011Fi, \u0130stanbul\u2019un
    y\xFCzy\u0131ll\u0131k al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015F k\xFClt\xFCr\xFCn\xFC ta\u015F\u0131r.
    Hanlar ve bedestenlerle \xF6r\xFCl\xFC 60\u2019tan fazla soka\u011F\u0131, farkl\u0131
    mesleklerin belirli b\xF6l\xFCmlerde topland\u0131\u011F\u0131 tarih\xEE \u015Fehir
    d\xFCzenini h\xE2l\xE2 hissettirir."
  _sector: "\u0130stanbul / T\xDCRK\u0130YE"
